ak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも、この曲を聴いたら思い出す!!みたいな曲ありますか⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにどんな曲ですか?☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は朝の空気を吸いながら〜とか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜空を見ながら〜とか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにその曲を聴いてみるとすごく良い感じに気持ちが切り替わる時がありますー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.keyakizaka46.com/images/14/9df/8b1accceef545a5e5d393b567a8c3-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上、最近の話でした〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武元唯衣でした🍀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイバイ〜👋🏻"}],"source":"official"}}